{
  "_comment": "Platform (non-application) resource-log category policy per resource type. Tiers are cumulative: security <= standard <= verbose. Every category was checked against the Microsoft Learn 'Supported resource log categories' page named in learn_page on _verified_on (snapshot: supported-categories.snapshot.json). Categories are still intersected at plan time with azurerm_monitor_diagnostic_categories, so an entry a resource does not support is skipped. 'supersedes': when the key category is selected, the listed categories are dropped (they would duplicate it).",
