      "cost": "kube-audit-admin excludes get/list events (Microsoft: significantly fewer logs than kube-audit). kube-audit (verbose) records every read and is usually the largest single source in a cluster; it replaces kube-audit-admin so events are never sent twice. kube-apiserver volume grows with API traffic.",
